@Risk_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005

### Health Check (Service)
GET {{Risk_HostAddress}}/api/risk/health
Accept: application/json

### Health Check (ASP.NET)
GET {{Risk_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Evaluate Risk - Approved (< 50,000 TRY)
POST {{Risk_HostAddress}}/api/risk/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transferId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
  "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "TRY"
}

### Evaluate Risk - Rejected (Exceeds Single Transaction Limit > 50,000 TRY)
POST {{Risk_HostAddress}}/api/risk/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transferId": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e",
  "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 75000.00,
  "currency": "TRY"
}
